Package: imedR
Type: Package
Title: Guarded Evidence Synthesis for the Indian Microplastics Evidence Database
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Chanikya",
    family = "Naidu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "thefisherieschanikyaneeti@gmail.com"
  )
Description: A research-grade, guardrail-first interface to the Indian
    Microplastics Evidence Database ('IMED'). It provides release-data access,
    relational and scientific validation, comparability-aware filtering,
    descriptive and inferential statistics, evidence-synthesis eligibility,
    meta-analysis helpers, publication figures, mapping, provenance and
    citation retrieval, and manuscript-oriented outputs. Unsafe pooling across
    incompatible matrices, denominators, mass bases and comparability classes
    is blocked by default.
